  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#browser-interface-elements documents `window.locationbar.visible` and related APIs. These APIs currently do anything especially useful.\n\nShould the spec say that these are obsolete or otherwise discouraged?\n\nThis information would be used in BCD to decide if https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/BarProp.json and related entries should be marked as deprecated, which in turn will affect a Baseline banner at the top of https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/BarProp\n\ncc @ddbeck",
